{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1450794-which-is-more-addictive-the-kiss-or-vitae","id":1450794,"title":"Which is more addictive? The Kiss? Or Vitae?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-03T03:22:59-07:00","id":1450794,"title":"Which is more addictive? The Kiss? Or Vitae?","content":"Which is more addictive to a victim? Receiving a vampire's kiss? Or drinking vampire Vitae?<br /> <br /> The kiss is said to have a euphoric effect on the victim and the kindred giving the kiss. Kine could come to enjoy it so much, they would beg a kindred for the kiss. Which is one way herds are created and maintained. <br /> <br /> While vampire Vitae is said to be extremely addictive compared to most drugs and ghouls would do anything to have some. If they are cut off, they may do crazy things or even beg/hunt other kindred for vitae.<br /> <br /> While both are not mutually exclusive, after all a ghoul can be addicted to both the kiss and Vitae. If only is to compare them, which would be more addictive?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26067-wingstorm","name":"Wingstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T03:32:10-07:00","id":1450795,"title":"","content":"Vitae<br /> <br /> The Kiss is like &quot;Woah, let's get me some more of that&quot; but it doesn't have the withdrawal process of Vitae. Vitae isn't initially so bad that your ghouls become non-functional junkies, but withdrawl puts them into &quot; I NEED IT GIMME GIMME YOU F...&quot; territory.<br /> <br /> This works practically. You're feeding from a lot more people than you're ghouling, so you can't have all the people you feed from super needy for your bite, that's too much management. With Ghouls, you want them dependent on you so you can depend on them.<br /> <br /> Edit: Another thing slowing down the bite adiction is that you've only got so much blood to give, so needing to be fed from a lot is not going to do you or the vampire many favours. Ghouls on the otherhand can age twenty years in a day* if they don't get their fix on time. So it's important for the ghoul to be intaking on the regular. <br /> *I don't think that's the actual rate of aging, but it probably feels like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 06-03-2021, 07:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T04:21:00-07:00","id":1450796,"title":"","content":"Yes, Vitae. It's so strong, it can turn a pack of ghouls on each other while they vie for attention if they are not properly managed. It's why you can't just make 50 ghouls by drinking 2 blood and giving 1 back over and over again until you have a superhuman army. It warps the mind and you need to put a little time into your minions to keep them in line is how I run it.<br /> <br /> Like human pets really. Think of dogs, if you had 1 dog it would be easy to potty train it and get it to stay off the couch. Two would be a little harder since 1 pees in the house the other smells it and pees as well, but it's still manageable. Try having a dozen dogs and you have a destroyed home unless they are the sole focus of your attention. Like a dog they are needy and want you to play with them and scratch their belly. Their kind of a handful really, you need a couple for daylight stuff, but too much more is a headache.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24221-vamps-like-us","name":"Vamps Like Us","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T10:18:20-07:00","id":1450843,"title":"","content":"Vitae, easily, as it is physically addictive, whereas the kiss is just psychologically habit forming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T10:37:11-07:00","id":1450849,"title":"","content":"Well, the kiss feels great... That's it.<br /> Vitae is just as mind blowing, gives you the eternal oxytocin rush of new love and the power rush of eternal youth, vitality and superpowers. And it lasts longer<br /> <br /> The kiss is probably your regular levels of addiction. Your brain gets one hell of a rush that stops at the end of the kiss, and you go back for it. Over time you become an addict, not much different from any other addict except you get it from being bitten by a vampire.<br /> <br /> Vitae fuels a vampire's disciplines such as protean and vicissitude, it keeps ghouls and vampires in stasis. It's not a reach, imo, to say that putting that stuff in you gives it free reign to rewire you to its purposes the second it hits your system, and to a greater extent than a drug would.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":26836,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","user":"Rhywbeth","date":". 06-03-2021, 02:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-05T04:47:01-07:00","id":1451041,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the insights! It really helped with some rping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26067-wingstorm","name":"Wingstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-30T09:03:50-07:00","id":1453847,"title":"","content":"I do know that in V5 there is a power called lingering kiss that specifically makes the kiss more addictive to a ridiculous degree.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26919-themercurian","name":"TheMercurian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}